# BORGHERTZS_VERMILLION_HANDS (jeuno 48): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job RDM, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 RDM: CastleOztroja's Treasure Coffer opens to
# WarlocksTabard (the item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +512 (bit 9); GarlaigeCitadel's to
# WarlocksTights: +1024 (bit 10).
lists CastleOztroja/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade GarlaigeCitadel/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=CastleOztroja pos=-99,-75,-129 job=RDM lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsVermillionHands accepted
item OztrojaCofferKey
item GarlaigeCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer OztrojaCofferKey x1 # bit 9 unset: WarlocksTabard; [AF]ZilartCoffer 512
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp -282.3,0,263.2 GarlaigeCitadel
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer GarlaigeCofferKey x1 # bit 10 unset: WarlocksTights; [AF]ZilartCoffer 1536
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
